{
  "name": "bearing_bracket_topopt",
  "project": "eval:bearing-bracket-topopt",
  "difficulty": 3,
  "description": "Generative design — prompt declares ONLY the interfaces (3x M8 blind taps + dia-30 bearing bore) inside a 120x70x90 envelope; codegen builds a solid design-space block, FEM sanity-checks, SIMP (declared keeps + auto, yz symmetry) carves the structure, refine restores exact interfaces.",
  "settings": {
    "gen_mode": "cad"
  },
  "stages": [
    {
      "id": "codegen",
      "type": "generate",
      "mode": "cad",
      "timeout_s": 5400,
      "options": {
        "process": "fdm"
      },
      "prompt": "Parametric seed body for a topology-optimized bearing bracket (aluminium 6061).\nThis is NOT the finished bracket — it is the solid design space the optimizer will carve.\n\nBUILD THIS — nothing more:\n1. One solid rectangular block, 120 (X) x 70 (Y) x 90 (Z) mm. Base face on the\n   XY plane at z = 0, centred at the origin in X and Y. Solid material\n   throughout: no ribs, no pockets, no cutouts, no webs, no chamfers, no\n   fillets, no hollow sections.\n2. Three blind holes, dia 6.8 mm, drilled from the BOTTOM face z = 0 to a\n   depth of 10 mm — they end inside the block: at (x=-46, y=+22),\n   (x=+46, y=+22) and (x=0, y=-22). Do NOT drill through.\n3. One through-bore dia 30 mm along Y at x = 0, z = 65 — the bearing seat.\n   Open on both the +y and -y faces.\n\nCHECK BEFORE FINISHING:\n- Each dia-6.8 hole opens only on the bottom face and ends inside the block.\n- The dia-30 bore is open on both y faces.\n- The block contains no other voids or features.\n\nService context for the spec: the bracket mounts to a base plate through the\nthree bottom holes; the bore carries ~8 kN radial shaft load downward plus\n~3 kN axial thrust along +Y. Symmetric across x = 0.",
      "gates": [
        {
          "type": "status",
          "expect": [
            "succeeded",
            "needs_review"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bbox",
          "dims": [
            120,
            70,
            90
          ],
          "match": "within",
          "tol_mm": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "volume",
          "min_mm3": 650000
        },
        {
          "type": "holes",
          "count": 3,
          "dia": 6.8,
          "axis": "z",
          "positions": [
            [
              -46,
              22
            ],
            [
              46,
              22
            ],
            [
              0,
              -22
            ]
          ],
          "depth_class": "blind"
        },
        {
          "type": "holes",
          "count": 1,
          "dia": 30,
          "axis": "y",
          "depth_class": "through"
        },
        {
          "type": "watertight",
          "expect": true
        },
        {
          "type": "verify_spec",
          "expect": "PASS"
        }
      ]
    },
